WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.376
Clicking a creature picks that copy, so its values are the ones shown.

2
00:00:05.026 --> 00:00:08.926
One Creature sprite, three copies, each with its own values.

3
00:00:10.987 --> 00:00:15.362
The click picks the Emberfox, so Creature dot name means Emberfox.

4
00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:22.666
Same event, a different pick. Now it reads the Tidecrab's values.
